fibrs

This crate is a Rust port of AVF_SPLINE_GENERATOR 0.2.0
(https://github.com/Qualzz/AVF_SPLINE_GENERATOR, commit bee798f7), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The tracing kernels (src/kernels.rs), the field preparation
(src/axes.rs, src/fields.rs), the finishing pass (src/finish.rs), the AFV writer
(src/afv.rs) and the command line (src/run.rs) reproduce that project's algorithms,
constants, schema and messages. The upstream project ships no NOTICE file. The
Apache License 2.0 text, under which this crate is licensed too, is in licenses/apache-2.0.txt.

src/pyfmt.rs ports NumPy 2.4.6's unsigned-integer introsort (npysort/quicksort.cpp,
aquicksort_) line for line, so that np.argsort's order of ties is reproduced. NumPy is
licensed under the BSD 3-Clause licence; its full text is in licenses/numpy.txt.

