  Copyright (c) 2019-present Blosc Development Team (licenses/c-blosc.txt). Its blosclz
  codec derives from FastLZ (MIT, Copyright (C) 2005-2020 Ariya Hidayat,
  licenses/c-blosc-fastlz.txt) and its bit shuffle from Bitshuffle (MIT, Copyright (c)
  2014 Kiyoshi Masui, licenses/c-blosc-bitshuffle.txt)
- LZ4 1.10.0 (lz4-sys): BSD-2-Clause, Copyright (c) 2011-2020 Yann Collet
  (licenses/lz4.txt)
- mimalloc 3.3.2 (libmimalloc-sys 0.1.49), the binary's allocator: MIT, Copyright (c) 2018-2025
  Microsoft Corporation, Daan Leijen (licenses/mimalloc.txt)
- Zstandard 1.5.7 (zstd-sys): BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and
